Package: universal-checker
Version: 1.0.0
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: nodejs, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-webkit2-4.1 | gir1.2-webkit2-4.0
Maintainer: sjaf <noreply@example.invalid>
Description: Xbox gamertag availability checker
 Universal Checker is a black-and-gold desktop app for checking Xbox
 gamertag availability, with an optional secondary policy check (Double
 Check) before a result is treated as alertable, and an optional Discord
 remote-control bot.
